     The macro EEVVEENNTTHHAANNDDLLEERR__RREEGGIISSTTEERR() and function eevveenntthhaannddlleerr__rreeggiisstteerr()
     return a cookie of type _e_v_e_n_t_h_a_n_d_l_e_r___t_a_g, which may be used in a subse‐
     quent call to EEVVEENNTTHHAANNDDLLEERR__DDEERREEGGIISSTTEERR() or eevveenntthhaannddlleerr__ddeerreeggiisstteerr().

     The eevveenntthhaannddlleerr__ffiinndd__lliisstt() function returns a pointer to an event han‐
     dler list corresponding to parameter _n_a_m_e, or NULL if no such list was
     found.

